# P7 polish: the plugin engine parameters print with the MK66 units in the Mini patch editor (PlugSynthVoice formatValue). The card holds
# pluck.plg and alco.plg (plus_flows.sh stages the logos card). Synth 1 steps to PLK as in *_logos.flow, F8 opens the patch editor in its section grid, Mid enters the first section (as mini_only_patch.flow), Down selects
# the second parameter of the first section (Pick Pos). plus_flows.sh reads the value text of the selected parameter afterwards (UISHOT_TRACE_SYNTHTEXT, the
# synthtext line): the last one must be "Pick Pos = 35%", the MK66 text at its default (OG emu: synthfmt 0 Pick_Pos 0.35 = 35%).
# Replay: plus_flows.sh mini
title: Plugin engine param units on the Mini (P7 polish)
check: texts
pause: 90ms

wait 1500ms
press Instr
wait 400ms
tap Up x3
wait 300ms
release Instr
wait 600ms
press Menu
wait 400ms
tap Right
wait 300ms
release Menu
wait 1500ms
expect text "Synth 1"
tap Down x4
wait 1500ms
expect text "PLK"
tap F8
wait 1500ms
expect text "Edit Patch"
shot units-editor
tap Mid
wait 400ms
tap Down
wait 1500ms
shot units-param
